# Require the repository owner's review on anything that can change what is
# deployed or the environment it runs with. Enforcement needs branch
# protection / rulesets (GitHub Pro for private repos); until then this is a
# visible signal in PRs, not a hard gate.
#
# Paths below cover the deploy pipeline and env configuration:
#   - deploy/**: kustomize overlays (ConfigMap esoqo-config), job templates,
#     secrets templates, and the deployer script.
#   - .github/**: CI workflows.
#   - Dockerfiles / compose: build-time env (NEXT_PUBLIC_* etc.).
#   - .env.example: documents the env surface.

/deploy/              @Emmanuel-Odero
/.github/             @Emmanuel-Odero
/docker-compose*.yml  @Emmanuel-Odero
Dockerfile*           @Emmanuel-Odero
/.env.example         @Emmanuel-Odero
